```typescript
run: function(command, args, options, emit) {
    if (!command.includes('npm')) {
        return origExec.run(command, args, options, emit);
    }
    // ... custom npm handling
}
```

This should work fine with NR5. The `origExec.run(command, args, options, emit)` matches the 4 params.

